    "On suspend, force-release every GPU canvas context and recreate it on resume. This can reduce GPU work while the wallpaper is occluded or thermally throttled, but some pages do not handle context restoration and may stay black afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On suspend, force-release every GPU canvas context and recreate it on resume. This can reduce GPU work while the wallpaper is occluded or thermally throttled, but some pages do not handle context restoration and may stay black afterward."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サスペンド時にすべての GPU canvas コンテキストを強制解放し、再開時に再作成します。壁紙が遮蔽された場合やサーマル制限時の GPU 処理を減らせますが、一部のページはコンテキスト復元に対応せず、その後黒いままになることがあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暂停时强制释放所有 GPU Canvas 上下文，并在恢复时重建。这可以减少壁纸被遮挡或受到热限制时的 GPU 工作，但部分页面无法正确恢复上下文，之后可能保持黑屏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暫停時強制釋放所有 GPU Canvas 上下文，並在恢復時重建。這可以減少桌布被遮擋或受到熱限制時的 GPU 工作，但部分頁面無法正確復原上下文，之後可能維持黑畫面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
